# Personal deploy guards (Rayito de Sol)

- Production path: GitHub PR → merge to `master` → Vercel Git integration only.
- Never run `vercel --prod`, `vercel link`, `vercel unlink`, or scope/project switching.
- Before any Vercel action, run `%LOCALAPPDATA%\cursor-agent\personal\scripts\Assert-PersonalProject.ps1 -ProjectSlug rayito-de-sol -Operation sensitive`.
- Use only fixed binding in `.deploy/binding.json`. Never accept destination IDs as arguments.
- No Supabase for this project.
- Secrets never go in git, chat, MCP JSON, or scripts. Use `CursorPersonal/rayito-de-sol/vercel/inspect`.
